  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **÷ and +**\n\n→ **2 ÷ 10** × 12 − 4 + 24 = 8\n\n→ **1/5 × 12** − 4 + 24 = 8\n\n→ **12/5** − 4 **+ 24 **= 8\n\n→ 132/5 - 4 ≠ 8\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **÷ and −**\n\n→ 2 + 10 × **12 ÷ 4** - 24 = 8\n\n→ 2 + **10 × 3** - 24 = 8\n\n→ **2 + 30** - 24 = 8\n\n→ 32 - 24 = 8\n\n→ 8 = 8\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n3) **× and ÷**\n\n→ 2 + **10 ÷ 12** − 4 × 24 = 8\n\n→ 2 + 5/6 − **4 ****×**** 24** = 8\n\n→ **2 + 5/6** − 96 = 8\n\n→ 17/6 − 96 ≠ 8\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **− and +**\n\n→ 2 - 10 × 12 + **4 ÷ 24** = 8\n\n→ 2 - **10 × 12** + 1/6 = 8\n\n→ **2 **- 120 **+ 1/6 **= 8\n\n→ 13/6 - 120 ≠ 8\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"÷ and −\"**.",
